  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">International Programme (ODA and non-ODA) in support of the BHC Apia Business and Country Plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme will enable a range of activities to support the delivery of the Samoa Business and Country Plan objectives. 

Projects may support any of the 3 main BCP objectives: economic resilience, security, and values.

A proportion of the non-ODA element of this programme will focus on working with the media and government institutions to boost perceptions of UK activity in Samoa in line with the UK&#x2019;s Pacific Strategy.</narrative>
  </description>
